# Cached replies and saved runs. Regenerable, occasionally large, and a result is only
# meaningful next to the prompt that produced it — which is tracked.
results/*
!results/.gitkeep

# Filled in from each provider's pricing page. Local because it goes stale and because two
# people on different plans have different numbers.
pricing.json

.venv/
__pycache__/

# Generated by `uv export` for the no-uv path in the README. pyproject.toml plus uv.lock are the
# tracked source; a committed copy would be the stale second answer to what the deps are.
requirements.txt

*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Notebook drafts written from the tweaking loop. Rename one to keep it.
prompts/draft.md
prompts/draft.schema.json
